    "spec": "In addition to the audit line, emit an immutable structured event via AUDIT: a JSON object {seq, ownerId, customerCode, membershipLevel, event:'OWNER_CREATED'} where seq is a monotonically increasing integer across creates. The event must carry the owner's current primary identifier: the customerCode here, and whatever replaces it later (so when the customerCode is unified into the memberId, the event carries the memberId instead).",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nIn addition to the audit line, emit an immutable structured event via AUDIT: a JSON object {seq, ownerId, customerCode, membershipLevel, event:'OWNER_CREATED'} where seq is a monotonically increasing integer across creates. The event must carry the owner's current primary identifier: the customerCode here, and whatever replaces it later (so when the customerCode is unified into the memberId, the event carries the memberId instead).\n"
